    <title>梯度下降Python代码学习记录</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/04/%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/04/%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="梯度下降代码学习"><a href="#梯度下降代码学习" class="headerlink" title="梯度下降代码学习"></a>梯度下降代码学习</h1><h2 id="一、简介"><a href="#一、简介" class="headerlink" title="一、简介"></a>一、简介</h2><p>在python环境下，首先画出一个抛物线，开口向上，然后用梯度下降的方法让小球运动到最低点</p><h2 id="二、不带PyTorch"><a href="#二、不带PyTorch" class="headerlink" title="二、不带PyTorch"></a>二、不带PyTorch</h2><p>###python代码</p><figure class="highlight dns"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dns">import matplotlib.pyplot as plt<br>import numpy as np<br># 解决中文显示<br>plt.rcParams[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;font.sans-serif&quot;</span>] = [<span class="hljs-string">&quot;SimHei&quot;</span>]<br>plt.rcParams[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;axes.unicode_minus&quot;</span>] = False<br># 创建画布<br>fig, ax = plt.subplots<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>figsize=<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">8</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_xlim<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_ylim<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_title<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;小球沿抛物线移动&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_xlabel<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;X&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_ylabel<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;Y&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.grid<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>True, alpha=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br><br># 抛物线参考轨迹<br>x_curve = np.linspace<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span>, <span class="hljs-number">200</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>y_curve = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">4</span> * <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x_curve - <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>**<span class="hljs-number">2</span> <br>ax.plot<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x_curve, y_curve, color=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;#6688ff&quot;</span>, linewidth=<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, label=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;运动轨迹&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br><br># 创建小球<br>ball, = ax.plot<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>[], [], &#x27;o&#x27;, color=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;#ff4444&quot;</span>, markersize=<span class="hljs-number">12</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>plt.legend<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># ========= 更新小球的函数 =========<br>def update_ball<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>:<br>    y = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">4</span> * <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x - <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>**<span class="hljs-number">2</span> <br>    ball.set_data<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>[x], [y]<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    fig.canvas.draw<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    fig.canvas.flush_events<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># 初始化小球在起点<br>update_ball<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>plt.pause<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>gamma=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">01</span><br>x=<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br># ========= for循环，循环更新小球 =========<br>for i <span class="hljs-type">in</span> range<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">10000</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>:<br>    x=x-gamma*<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">8</span>*<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x-<span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    update_ball<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    #plt.pause<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">05</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>  # 数字越大，小球移动越慢<br>plt.show<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>###运行图片<img src="/img/img1.png" alt="alt text"></p><h2 id="二、带PyTorch自动求导"><a href="#二、带PyTorch自动求导" class="headerlink" title="二、带PyTorch自动求导"></a>二、带PyTorch自动求导</h2><p>###python代码</p><figure class="highlight dns"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dns">import matplotlib.pyplot as plt<br>import numpy as np<br>import torch<br># 解决中文显示<br>plt.rcParams[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;font.sans-serif&quot;</span>] = [<span class="hljs-string">&quot;SimHei&quot;</span>]<br>plt.rcParams[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;axes.unicode_minus&quot;</span>] = False<br># 创建画布<br>fig, ax = plt.subplots<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>figsize=<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">8</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_xlim<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_ylim<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_title<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;小球沿抛物线移动&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_xlabel<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;X&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.set_ylabel<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;Y&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>ax.grid<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>True, alpha=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># 抛物线参考轨迹<br>x_curve = np.linspace<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10</span>, <span class="hljs-number">200</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>y_curve = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">4</span> * <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x_curve - <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>**<span class="hljs-number">2</span> <br>ax.plot<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x_curve, y_curve, color=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;#6688ff&quot;</span>, linewidth=<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, label=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;运动轨迹&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># 创建小球<br>ball, = ax.plot<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>[], [], &#x27;o&#x27;, color=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;#ff4444&quot;</span>, markersize=<span class="hljs-number">12</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>plt.legend<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># ========= 更新小球的函数 =========<br>def update_ball<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x1<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>:<br>    y1 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">4</span> * <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x1 - <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>**<span class="hljs-number">2</span> <br>    ball.set_data<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>[x1], [y1]<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    fig.canvas.draw<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    fig.canvas.flush_events<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># 初始化小球在起点<br>update_ball<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>plt.pause<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>gamma=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">01</span><br>x = torch.tensor<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span>], requires_grad=True<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br># ========= for循环，循环更新小球 =========<br>for i <span class="hljs-type">in</span> range<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">10000</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>:<br>    y = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">4</span> * <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x - <span class="hljs-number">5</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span> ** <span class="hljs-number">2</span><br>    # 自动求导，计算 dy/dx<br>    y.backward<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    with torch.no_grad<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>:#临时关闭 PyTorch 的自动求导计算<br>        x -= gamma * x.grad<br>    x_data=x.detach<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>.item<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    update_ball<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>x_data<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    x.grad.zero_<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>    #plt.pause<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">05</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>  # 数字越大，小球移动越慢<br>plt.show<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>###运行图片<img src="/img/img2.png" alt="alt text"></p><h2 id="PyTorch-简介"><a href="#PyTorch-简介" class="headerlink" title="PyTorch 简介"></a>PyTorch 简介</h2><p>PyTorch是Meta开源深度学习框架，核心数据结构为张量(Tensor)，支持CPU&#x2F;GPU加速、动态图、自动微分Autograd，广泛用于科研与工程。导入：<code>import torch</code></p><h3 id="张量创建"><a href="#张量创建" class="headerlink" title="张量创建"></a>张量创建</h3><p><code>torch.tensor()</code> 从列表建立张量<br><code>torch.zeros(*size)</code> 全0张量<br><code>torch.ones(*size)</code> 全1张量<br><code>torch.eye(n)</code> 单位矩阵<br><code>torch.rand(*size)</code> [0,1)均匀随机<br><code>torch.randn(*size)</code> 标准正态分布<br><code>torch.arange(start, end, step)</code> 生成序列</p><h3 id="张量属性"><a href="#张量属性" class="headerlink" title="张量属性"></a>张量属性</h3><p><code>.shape</code> 获取形状<br><code>.size()</code> 获取形状，等价于shape<br><code>.dtype</code> 数据类型<br><code>.device</code> 运行设备(cpu&#x2F;cuda:0)<br><code>.requires_grad</code> 是否开启梯度记录</p><h3 id="形状变换"><a href="#形状变换" class="headerlink" title="形状变换"></a>形状变换</h3><p><code>.reshape()</code> 改变形状<br><code>.view()</code> 改变视图，内存共享<br><code>.squeeze()</code> 删除维度为1的轴<br><code>.unsqueeze(dim)</code> 新增维度<br><code>.transpose(dim0, dim1)</code> 交换两维<br><code>.permute(*dims)</code> 多维度重排</p><h3 id="数学运算"><a href="#数学运算" class="headerlink" title="数学运算"></a>数学运算</h3><p><code>torch.add(a,b)</code> 加法<br><code>torch.matmul(a,b)</code> 矩阵乘法，等价 <code>a @ b</code><br><code>torch.pow(a,n)</code> 幂运算<br><code>torch.sqrt(a)</code> 平方根<br><code>torch.sum()</code> 求和<br><code>torch.mean()</code> 求均值<br><code>torch.max()</code> 最大值<br><code>torch.argmax()</code> 最大值下标</p><h3 id="自动微分-Autograd"><a href="#自动微分-Autograd" class="headerlink" title="自动微分 Autograd"></a>自动微分 Autograd</h3><p><code>torch.tensor(..., requires_grad=True)</code> 开启梯度<br><code>.backward()</code> 反向传播求梯度<br><code>.grad</code> 读取梯度<br><code>.grad.zero_()</code> 梯度清零</p><h3 id="设备迁移"><a href="#设备迁移" class="headerlink" title="设备迁移"></a>设备迁移</h3><p><code>.to(&quot;cuda&quot;)</code> 迁移至GPU<br><code>.cuda()</code> 迁移至GPU<br><code>.to(&quot;cpu&quot;)</code> 迁移至CPU<br><code>.cpu()</code> 迁移至CPU</p><h3 id="Tensor-与-Numpy互转"><a href="#Tensor-与-Numpy互转" class="headerlink" title="Tensor 与 Numpy互转"></a>Tensor 与 Numpy互转</h3><p><code>torch.from_numpy(arr)</code> numpy转tensor<br><code>.numpy()</code> tensor转numpy（仅限CPU张量）</p><h3 id="torch-utils-data"><a href="#torch-utils-data" class="headerlink" title="torch.utils.data"></a>torch.utils.data</h3><p><code>Dataset</code> 自定义数据集基类<br><code>DataLoader</code> 批量数据加载器</p><h3 id="torch-nn"><a href="#torch-nn" class="headerlink" title="torch.nn"></a>torch.nn</h3><p><code>nn.Linear()</code> 全连接层<br><code>nn.Conv2d()</code> 二维卷积<br><code>nn.ReLU()</code> ReLU激活函数<br><code>nn.MSELoss()</code> 均方误差损失<br><code>nn.CrossEntropyLoss()</code> 交叉熵分类损失</p><h3 id="torch-optim"><a href="#torch-optim" class="headerlink" title="torch.optim"></a>torch.optim</h3><p><code>optim.SGD()</code> 随机梯度下降优化器<br><code>optim.Adam()</code> Adam优化器<br><code>.step()</code> 更新模型参数<br><code>.zero_grad()</code> 梯度清零</p>]]></content>
    
    
